0054             90   ; In the 8051 we have variables that are 1-bit in size.  We can use the setb, clr, jb, and jnb
0054             91   ; instructions with these variables.  This is how you define a 1-bit variable:
0000             92   bseg
0000             93   half_seconds_flag: dbit 1 ; Set to one in the ISR every time 500 ms had passed
0001             94   mf : dbit 1
